{"id":51505,"date":"2026-05-30T00:17:24","date_gmt":"2026-05-29T23:17:24","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51505"},"modified":"2026-09-04T21:32:16","modified_gmt":"2026-09-04T20:32:16","slug":"corrida-multicare-vitality","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-multicare-vitality\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida Multicare Vitality 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida Multicare Vitality 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida Multicare Vitality 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no fim de semana de <strong>17 e 18 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong> no hist\u00f3rico <strong>Centro Desportivo Nacional do Jamor<\/strong>, em <strong>Oeiras<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong>HMS Sports<\/strong> e pela <strong>Fidelidade \/ Multicare<\/strong>, a iniciativa \u00e9 uma celebra\u00e7\u00e3o da sa\u00fade e da vida ativa para todas as idades, com 100% da receita l\u00edquida a reverter a favor dos <strong>Palha\u00e7os d\u2019Opital<\/strong> e da <strong>SOS Animal<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e meta instaladas na pista do Est\u00e1dio de Honra do Jamor, o programa inicia-se no s\u00e1bado, 17 de Outubro, \u00e0s <strong>15h00<\/strong> com a animada <strong>C\u00e3ominhada de 2 km<\/strong>. No domingo, 18 de Outubro, as provas come\u00e7am \u00e0s <strong>09h00<\/strong> com a <strong>Corrida das Crian\u00e7as<\/strong> (Bambis, Benjamins e Infantis) e \u00e0s <strong>10h00<\/strong> com a <strong>Corrida 10 km<\/strong>, <strong>Corrida 5 km<\/strong> e <strong>Caminhada 5 km<\/strong>, num circuito envolvente por alcatr\u00e3o, terra batida e relva.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">17 e 18 de